{"claims":[{"claim_text":"In a society that assures income security, loss of a job will open opportunities to new employment without the pressure to accept the first job offer that emerges.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Income security gives all people the freedom to take a chance on a new job that may more fully develop their potential as workers and as human beings.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Income security provides the economic space for development of independent ideas and thinking.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Independent ideas and thinking provide the basis for an independent politics that articulates the needs and wants of the population as a whole rather than the desires and fancies of a wealthy elite.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"The assurance of adequate income for all, even in periods of employment transition, increases the economic potential of the entire society.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"Income security encourages cooperation between capital and labor to apply new technologies and seek new areas of investment, instead of desperate efforts to retain jobs in industries that are undergoing rapid technological change and possible employment loss.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"The result of income security and cooperation between capital and labor is a society that moves towards its economic potential and an economics and economic policy whose goals are for all people to live “wisely, agreeably and well”.", "claim_types":["prediction"],"evidence_ids":[2]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
```

